# EduTalent Internationalization (i18n) - Bilingual English/Farsi

## High-Level Objective
Make EduTalent a fully bilingual application supporting English and Farsi (Persian) with:
- Farsi as default language
- Complete RTL (Right-to-Left) layout support for Farsi
- Locale-specific grading system (20-based for Farsi, 100-based for English)
- Comprehensive translation of all UI text

---

## Phase 1: Core i18n Infrastructure
- [x] Create i18n module structure in `packages/web/src/i18n/`
- [x] Implement `Locale` enum (En, Fa) with Farsi as default
- [x] Create translation key registry (type-safe keys)
- [x] Build translation loading mechanism with HashMap-based system
- [x] Create `LocaleProvider` context for global language state
- [x] Add `use_locale()` hook for component access
- [x] Add `LanguageSwitcher` component

